change, excellence and internationalism continue to guide ACS today. An ACS education has at its heart the idea of readiness: When they leave ACS, our students face the world as effective, confident, and caring individuals who are ready to act, lead, care, and change the world."], [21, "p", 1082, 0, 0, "At the highest level, our purpose is to inspire the world’s next global thinkers and doers. As we look to the future, ACS remains as true to its international education roots now as ever."], [45, "h3", 1373, 0, 0, "Our charitable mission"], [24, "p", 1478, 0, 0, "ACS International Schools group is a dynamic, people-focused charity that advances education."], [21, "p", 1595, 0, 0, "As a charity, ACS is committed to advancing education by providing a range of means-tested bursary places and working locally and internationally in collaboration with schools and communities to share expertise and resources to enrich the education of our partner communities and ourselves."], [16, "span", 1858, 0, 0, "Charity & Fundraising"], [66, "h2", 2115, 0, 0, "Our Core Values"], [24, "p", 2282, 0, 0, "ACS has five values that everyone at ACS is committed to living and working by, to ensure we deliver the aims and ambitions we hold for each other and for our students."], [33, "h3", 2267, 0, 0, "Imagine Better"], [21, "p", 2315, 0, 0, "We look for innovative solutions and explore new ideas."], [33, "h3", 2267, 0, 0, "Aim high and make it happen"], [21, "p", 2348, 0, 0, "We have high standards and expect each other to meet and exceed them."], [33, "h3", 2742, 0, 0, "Welcome Everyone"], [21, "p", 2823, 0, 0, "We believe every person has unique contributions to make to each other and to the world."], [33, "h3", 2742, 0, 0, "Work together"], [21, "p", 2790, 0, 0, "We collaborate eagerly, with each other, with our partners, and with local and global communities."], [33, "h3", 2742, 0, 0, "Act with kindness"], [21, "p", 2823, 0, 0, "We act with kindness, transparency and compassion."], [26, "p", 3331, 0, 0, "The values are very much part of everyday life at ACS, and I have seen many examples where the values are played back through the work of the whole community. Specifically it is the way that our students, staff, families, and alumni have all given their time and resources to support each other and important causes that really shines through, along with our openness to welcome everyone, work together and inspire all to do the best they can."], [18, "figcaption", 3555, 0, 0, "Tim Cagney, Chief Executive, ACS International Schools"], [45, "h3", 3802, 0, 0, "Diversity, Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging"], [24, "p", 3952, 0, 0, "We are proud of our culturally-diverse community of students, families, staff, and alumni."], [21, "p", 4069, 0, 0, "We recognise that we have an important role to play in being a positive catalyst for change."], [21, "p", 4171, 0, 0, "As an organisation of four schools, we have listened to our community and this has helped us create a voluntary Diversity, Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging Council to move the agenda forward."], [16, "span", 4347, 0, 0, "Discover our Community"], [16, "span", 4615, 0, 0, "See All News"], [72, "h2", 4574, 0, 0, "What's Happening"], [14, "span", 4785, 0, 0, "Jul"], [14, "span", 4785, 0, 0, "2026"], [33, "h3", 4818, 0, 0, "How does the International Baccalaureate Diploma prepare students for an AI future?"], [14, "span", 4996, 0, 0, "Jun"], [33, "h3", 5029, 0, 0, "69% of UK universities say IB diploma is the “best pathway to thrive”"], [33, "h3", 5240, 0, 0, "AI in Schools: Expert Tips for Parents to Support Learning Safely and Effectively"], [84, "h2", 5775, 0, 0, "Where Next?"], [34, "p", 5980, 0, 0, "Strategic Plan"], [34, "p", 6097, 0, 0, "Leadership Team"], [34, "p", 6214, 0, 0, "Our History"]], "links": [["https://www.acs-schools.com/about/visit-us/", "Book a visit"], ["https://www.acs-schools.com/about/purpose-vision-and-values/", "Skip to content"], ["https://www.acs-schools.com/about/enquire/"